 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how have you been?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm alright, a bit tired.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.83,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "We need to fix the old wooden fence in the backyard and I'm weighing a few choices.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "block": "home_repair.opt2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "First let me tell you about all of them, then you can comment.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instr_11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure thing.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.53,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "One is just replacing the few broken boards and painting the whole thing.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.82,
   "block": "home_repair.opt2",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Another option is tearing it down and putting in a new wooden fence, which is a big weekend project.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 2.0,
   "block": "home_repair.opt2",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Or there's a vinyl fence, more expensive at first but it basically never needs paint again.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.62,
   "block": "home_repair.opt2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And that's the last one. What do you think?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Are the posts still solid, or are they rotting too? If the posts are fine, just fix the boards. If they're going, I'd skip patching and go with the vinyl, since you'd be rebuilding anyway.",
   "est_sec": 10.95,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "home_repair.opt2"
  }
 ]
}
